Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:29.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:30.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:33.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dear Mr. Naoki Irie,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:37.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am Kotoko Aihara, a senior in class F.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:43.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your speech at the freshmen entrance ceremony \Nwas so smart and cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:46.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,that, for the past two years, \NI've been in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:54.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But since classes are split by academic achievement,\N and my grades are bad enough to land me in class F,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:58.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've never been in class A with you and the smart kids before,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:02.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so, in my senior year, I've decided to \Ncome clean and confess my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:19.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you please accept this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:24.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:27.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You forgot a T.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:30.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's a T missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:37.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here, with a tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:40.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hate stupid girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I forgot a T?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:04.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:12.21,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Itazura na Kiss: High School Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:41.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She gave a love letter to Irie from class A!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:41.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:43.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning Satomi, Jinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:58.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You really confessed your love to Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:03.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He has an IQ of 200 and always \Nscores a 100% on tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:06.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And he's won every national tennis tournament he's entered!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's irritatingly perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:12.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, count the alphabet on your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A, B, C, D, E...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:19.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,F! See? F is on the other hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Class F is the class for losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:26.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie exists in a world different from ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:31.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought maybe there could be a \Nfraction of a chance he likes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:34.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, no chance in a billion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:39.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There are plenty of normal \Nguys who'd be a better match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:48.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:51.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:52.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You ignore me and confess your love to Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm your girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:03.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Haven't we been sitting next to each other\N for two years? That's ice cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:09.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Damn Irie, I can't stand how he embarassed you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're too worked up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's the bell, class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:16.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:23.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be taking the attendance now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:24.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ikezawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Inoue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:27.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:28.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uchida.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:39.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since falling in love with \NIrie in my freshman year,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:43.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've been secretly checking \Nhim out from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:13.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On the days I see him, I put a \Nheart sticker in my student calender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:18.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But when I finally decided to confess...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My senior year began with \Na rejected love letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.93,0:07:33.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess I should give up \Non that cold-hearted guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:37.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My poor little letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:49.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.79,0:07:56.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your family is moving soon right? \NWhen's it happening? I wanna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:08:00.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But we already moved all our furniture yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about a housewarming party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:09.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The thing is, we're renovating the kitchen \Nand the gas is still shut off. So—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:10.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:12.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll just bring food. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:17.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Catch you later. Love you Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:18.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:24.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pushy as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:29.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, he is trying to cheer you up \Nafter what happened this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:30.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's being considerate, in his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:34.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nicer than you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:39.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should forget the ice \Nguy settle for Kinnosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:42.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko and Kin, a perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:52.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No matter how it turned out, it was a bad idea \Nto give a letter to a guy you've never talked to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:55.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, anyone would be shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:09:00.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It wasn't really sudden. \NWe've had a serious chat before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A serious chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:04.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:07.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A year ago, after an exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How did you do on English?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I got a 38. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The same, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:18.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You, Jinko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:23.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I flunked. Who cares? I'll \Nmarry a Japanese guy anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:26.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, let's forget it and \Ngo eat some ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:27.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:29.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:30.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Par...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My test!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:39.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Japanese!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,English!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:45.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Missing math! Math, math...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:52.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, I got a 27 on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:05.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for picking it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:07.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:14.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,At long last! A real conversation with Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:26.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your imagination is definitely askew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.23,0:10:29.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously. It's working overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm just being positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:33.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:37.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your positive counterpart is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:41.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a cool looking house!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's really traditional, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:50.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad got it from a friend at a low price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:55.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I really wanted a western \None with bow windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey dad, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hiya! Kotoko, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:10.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your new home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:13.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko and Satomi, pretty as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:16.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:17.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:19.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Make yourselves at home! Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:22.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:29.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:30.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:40.18,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Road Work
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go ahead and start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:12:00.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Y'know, if the gas was working, I could've\N made a feast for you kids! Sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, no, don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:05.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll enjoy your pro cooking some other time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:08.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:11.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara, we're starting on the gas line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:13.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:25.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:32.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That is too solid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:34.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, don't slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That wasn't an earthquake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:43.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe it was the construction work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:49.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nonsense. You're a pretty funny guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:52.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen up, this house is from\N when they built stuff to last!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:14.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... but it's supposed to be sturdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad, hurry! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:34.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get clear! This is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:52.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop drilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:56.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop the drilling! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:13:59.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I said stop drilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey you, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:11.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The shaking from the the drill \Ndamn near shook the house apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:16.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:23.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How did you feel when it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...I...was shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:00.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never seen anything like it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:02.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a miracle no one was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:03.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:09.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,At 6 P.M. yesterday, Mr. \NShigeo Aihara's house
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.93,0:15:14.56,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Drill's Vibrations Cause House to Collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.89,0:15:14.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,in Suginami, Tokyo was met with disaster \Ncaused by drilling to access a nearby gas line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:29.66,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Termites At Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:35.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:38.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seems like you're always \Nthe center of attention, lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:44.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is how it feels to \Nwant to crawl under a brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:47.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean a rock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:53.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko Aihara's house was destroyed yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:56.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so we're looking for \Ndonations to help her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:58.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that Kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is he crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:04.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please give whatever you can! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop, Kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tragedy hits and still she comes to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I said stop! You stupid dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:19.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:23.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean? \NWhose fault do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:25.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whoever was manning that drill?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:26.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:31.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko didn't have a bad \Nluck streak until you shot her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting I made the pillars crack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:38.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Damn right! Your rotten \Nheart rotted her pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:44.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll donate to stop your complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't insult me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:49.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll die before taking your charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you really in a position to refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:57.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The last thing I want is to owe you anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.29,0:17:01.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:04.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't make a fool out of me, \Njust because I'm stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:09.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll show him I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:15.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My name is getting on the \Nscoreboard after this next test!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:18.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, you gotta make \Nthe top 100 for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No one in class F has done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not in the history of Tonan High School!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you sane right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:28.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Watch me make history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:48.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The object is experiencing \Na centripetal force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This establishes the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:52.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:55.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:13.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never imagined termites \Ncould've eat the pillars apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:18.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You being on the news has \Nmade me a laughing stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:22.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, after I was on TV, Iri contacted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who's Iri?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:27.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My best friend, who's putting us up. \NWe were in junior high school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:29.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Guy was a genius, went to Tokyo University.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:35.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You and his eldest son are the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:36.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And go to the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:38.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here! Please stop here! \NThis is where we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow! What an incredible house!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They even have a pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:52.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's the CEO of a big company.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:54.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.78,0:18:57.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, ring the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:04.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:08.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's taking you?\NRing it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:11.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:16.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Iri! It's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:20.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've been waiting to roll out \Nthe welcome wagon for you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You could've asked me to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm already imposing on you, too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.82,0:19:31.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, what are friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:37.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You must be Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:44.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look just like your mom. So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:48.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't look like him. That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing... Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:54.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My pleasure. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:56.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.55,0:19:58.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About 5 kg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:20:00.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:02.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to trouble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:07.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, they're here! Come introduce yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nao!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Nao"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Naoki, the eldest son. \NNice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:20.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That s fine  son you got there, Iri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:21.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:25.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:30.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I-I guess I ended up owing you, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:40.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're in nowhere near the same class, but \Nwe've recently become acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:42.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:45.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They were like peas in a pod this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:46.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who took those?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:48.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Honestly, mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:52.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come in, Aihara, and make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:54.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:55.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:56.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:57.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you a pretty girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's going to be nice having \Nsome company around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ma'am, we lost everything. \NYour kindness is appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:19.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's our pleasure. I'm just glad\Nto have another girl around!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We only have boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:27.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is Kotoko. Introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:32.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Yuki Irie, third year \Nelementary school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:40.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm studying kanji. Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kanji for third graders? I can handle that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:51.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh... river horse? Sea sun? And nut mouse, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What're you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:56.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Those are hippo, starfish, and squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:57.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:22:02.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, that's unacceptable. Apologize now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.22,0:22:10.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.18,0:22:12.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:14.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:20.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let me show you to your room. \NI worked hard decorating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:21.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:22.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This way, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:26.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:30.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:34.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:35.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:45.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I always wanted a daughter to \Nshare girly things with!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.26,0:22:47.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:22:52.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.73,0:22:56.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're all for you. Wear whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:59.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why so many?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:03.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This was Yuki's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His stuff is in my room. \NIt's cramped, as you'd imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:13.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're his big brother, \Nso stop making such a fuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:16.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:21.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never mind what he says, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.05,0:23:22.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:25.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:31.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Help us unpack these gifts I bought for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:33.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:40.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You two go to the same school, \Nso try to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:45.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.41,0:23:51.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, what do you need me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:54.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't bother. I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:56.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:59.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I seem to recall you not wanting to owe me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.34,0:24:05.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just so you know, you being here \Nmakes no difference to me either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:12.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just stay out of my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:19.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.02,0:24:26.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He really does have ice \Nrunning through his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.62,0:24:35.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How the heck did I end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.75,0:24:40.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here's to termites!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.75,0:24:43.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The termintes got to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:47.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here's to termites!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.47,0:24:55.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:24:58.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Put your things away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.18,0:25:00.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.23,0:25:02.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.61,0:25:08.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The men have started drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:10.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why don't we have tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.45,0:25:16.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You seem down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.91,0:25:19.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.00,0:25:22.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.42,0:25:25.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've gone through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.05,0:25:26.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Exhausted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.38,0:25:30.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is your room now, feel free to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:32.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.64,0:25:37.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why don't you take off your jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.27,0:25:38.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.56,0:25:41.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:46.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't worry what Naoki said, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:50.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He can be such a sourpuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.03,0:25:55.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe it, \Nbut he used to be so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.45,0:25:56.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:25:58.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.25,0:26:08.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know. Let me show you something amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.13,0:26:09.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.27,0:26:22.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:29.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to show this to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.03,0:26:33.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are these pictures of Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.36,0:26:34.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:45.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What an adorable girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:47.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.59,0:26:48.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.63,0:26:51.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.22,0:26:56.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He looks just like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.22,0:27:00.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I really wanted a baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:04.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To be honest, I was shocked to have a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.77,0:27:10.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And since it would've been a shame \Nto let the clothes go to waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.23,0:27:13.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I made him wear them until he refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.91,0:27:19.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even Yuki doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:22.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It'll be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.29,0:27:23.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.37,0:27:27.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:29.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:30.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Check out the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:36.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:38.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.68,0:27:42.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come to my restaurant next time you can. \NI'll make you all the pufferfish you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.56,0:27:43.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.18,0:27:45.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be there in a puff!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.19,0:27:51.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.73,0:27:54.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.78,0:27:56.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't stare, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.28,0:27:59.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, what's wrong? Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:01.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.45,0:28:05.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, did you sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.04,0:28:06.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.21,0:28:09.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,From today, this is your home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.42,0:28:11.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.38,0:28:13.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You can marry into the family too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.67,0:28:18.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, well, she's still just in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.51,0:28:19.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.35,0:28:24.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Iri, thank you so much again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.77,0:28:26.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:31.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.90,0:28:32.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:34.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.53,0:28:36.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.36,0:28:40.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've put lunch boxes in \NNaoki's and Kotoko's bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.49,0:28:45.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, you two headed \Nthe same way, go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.58,0:28:47.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:47.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.83,0:28:49.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gone in a puff!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.08,0:28:52.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, show her the way, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.75,0:28:55.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal. We're heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:56.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.51,0:28:57.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:01.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You finish your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:04.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let them go alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.81,0:29:06.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Back to breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.86,0:29:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When are you gonna get home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.36,0:29:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got practice, so probably not until six.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.63,0:29:42.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:44.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.05,0:29:45.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't walk beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.77,0:29:51.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Learn the route to school, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.73,0:29:53.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And promise me three things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:56.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No one can know we live together,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.57,0:29:58.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,no talking to me at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.19,0:30:02.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and stay 3 steps, no, 3 meters back \Nwhen we walk outside together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.86,0:30:04.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Isn't that kind of excessive?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:07.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't want any weird rumors getting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:11.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As I said, I hate stupid girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.09,0:30:21.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll have my revenge one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:29.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, let's hang out this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.02,0:30:32.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can't. I have to study for the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.27,0:30:33.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.44,0:30:36.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're serious about \Nmaking class F history?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:37.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.86,0:30:40.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:46.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Grab your bag and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.78,0:30:50.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, what's the \Nhotshot from class A want?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:55.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What? Wait a sec. \NStop, don't go with him. Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.76,0:31:07.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.68,0:31:11.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mom put the wrong lunchbox in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.73,0:31:14.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:20.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For someone who doesn't want to talk, \Nyou broke your own rule already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.11,0:31:24.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What else was I supposed to do? \NWires have gotten crossed from living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.28,0:31:26.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.49,0:31:31.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll get so confused \Nyou'll wear my skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:33.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:37.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.63,0:31:39.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, aren't you the cutest?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:41.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.55,0:31:43.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A gift from your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.30,0:31:45.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even a genius has a weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.76,0:31:47.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Enough, give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.55,0:31:48.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.60,0:31:51.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you'll make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:52.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're blackmailing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:53.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.31,0:31:56.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tutor me for the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.48,0:32:00.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get me on the board, and I'll give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.86,0:32:03.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I refuse. It'd take divine \Nintervention to manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.78,0:32:07.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say no and I'll copy it and the whole school...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.61,0:32:08.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.66,0:32:11.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're starting tonight. All night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.41,0:32:14.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And it's going to be harsh. \NSo brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.58,0:32:18.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Harsh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.04,0:32:20.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.01,0:32:26.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.55,0:32:28.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is something going on with you and Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:30.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.68,0:32:32.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.68,0:32:36.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for me to hit the books!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.48,0:32:46.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.49,0:32:48.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:51.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How did it go with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.08,0:32:55.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You didn't each lunch together?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.62,0:32:56.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.79,0:33:00.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even after I set up an excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:04.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, you know how Naoki acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.25,0:33:06.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'll need to get aggressive with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:08.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aggressive to what end?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.26,0:33:10.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home, Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.89,0:33:15.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't believe you got the \Nlunches mixed up. Get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:18.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone makes mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.52,0:33:18.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.14,0:33:23.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here's hoping Naoki \Nwill make a certain mistake soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.03,0:33:35.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.62,0:33:37.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.83,0:33:39.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're young, eat more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.21,0:33:42.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got to start studying for an exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.42,0:33:46.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What? You're going to study?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.21,0:33:49.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's the spirit. I'll bring you snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.76,0:33:50.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.93,0:33:52.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Bring enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.93,0:33:57.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you going to study with Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.06,0:33:58.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.68,0:34:00.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.89,0:34:05.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki actually studying! And it's all \Nthanks to Kotoko, right, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.82,0:34:08.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You realize this is your fault, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.15,0:34:10.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.82,0:34:14.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, teach me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.66,0:34:17.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're at the top of your class \Nalready. There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.17,0:34:25.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What don't you understand, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.25,0:34:28.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't understand what \Nparts I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.21,0:34:31.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd be curious to see what your brain looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.76,0:34:33.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why do you even go to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.76,0:34:36.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, shouldn't I be going {\i1}because{\i0} I'm dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.85,0:34:41.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, how do you study?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.89,0:34:45.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't. I memorize \Neverything I see and hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.48,0:34:47.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You really are a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.65,0:34:49.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whatever. Finish the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.86,0:34:55.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's see... the volume's proportional \Nto the cubed radius, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.03,0:34:57.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.87,0:35:00.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can't you think without talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.25,0:35:06.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Review the fundamentals. What's pi?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.96,0:35:08.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pi?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.21,0:35:12.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't expect anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.26,0:35:16.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's 3.14! Just like White Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.18,0:35:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.80,0:35:21.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry. Am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.93,0:35:23.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.35,0:35:26.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because you two look so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.27,0:35:27.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wanted it on the record!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:29.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.48,0:35:33.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, am I a third wheel? Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.28,0:35:35.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here are the snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.07,0:35:39.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You two are a perfect match.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.41,0:35:42.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.99,0:35:44.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you stop spouting \Nidiotic nonsense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:49.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.71,0:35:50.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.30,0:36:01.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.97,0:36:03.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can I use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.43,0:36:04.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.15,0:36:11.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The pen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.49,0:36:18.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen up. There are only five days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.86,0:36:21.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We can't review everything in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.62,0:36:24.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Try these exercises I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.70,0:36:25.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:36.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You need to memorize these formulas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.34,0:36:37.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.01,0:36:40.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Manage that and you'll \Nat least score an 80. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.26,0:36:41.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.26,0:36:44.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You need this for that question. \NJust like the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.15,0:36:50.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.70,0:37:02.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Attitude."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.95,0:37:04.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Behavior."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.79,0:37:10.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Looking forward to i-n-g."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:57.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara, Papa, enjoy your class reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.63,0:38:00.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll be back tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.63,0:38:03.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll grab lots of souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.72,0:38:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.43,0:38:04.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.35,0:38:05.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.18,0:38:07.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.72,0:38:08.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.68,0:38:09.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.52,0:38:14.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They seem excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:16.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hope the food will be good. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.69,0:38:22.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello, Irie household.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.28,0:38:26.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Suzuko, it's been a while. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.16,0:38:30.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What? You're on a flight \Ncoming from America?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.79,0:38:34.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's always sudden with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.21,0:38:35.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't just drop everything to...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.71,0:38:42.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.01,0:38:45.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it. Fukuoka Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.05,0:38:48.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right. Right. I understand. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.39,0:38:54.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.19,0:38:57.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're spending the night out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.69,0:39:00.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get your things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.91,0:39:10.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, can I talk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:11.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.62,0:39:14.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Could you house-sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.54,0:39:16.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.29,0:39:22.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My mother lives in Kyushu and \Nit seems she's in poor health.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.17,0:39:27.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My sister is headed \Nover from America to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.47,0:39:29.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.10,0:39:34.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nothing serious but \NBut I want to visit her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.60,0:39:36.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, Can you house-sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.40,0:39:38.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.81,0:39:41.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take Yuki since he's still little.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.32,0:39:42.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.32,0:39:44.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks. The house is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.65,0:39:47.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.62,0:39:49.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.03,0:39:51.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right. Just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.66,0:39:54.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.12,0:39:57.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:39:59.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fine, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.18,0:40:09.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, Kotoko, we're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.55,0:40:11.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.64,0:40:14.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, take care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.60,0:40:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.68,0:40:16.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.85,0:40:17.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.56,0:40:19.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.94,0:40:21.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.45,0:40:27.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.57,0:40:28.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.66,0:40:31.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No afternoon classes on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.58,0:40:33.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll start studying at three.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.87,0:40:36.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come straight home. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.41,0:40:37.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.71,0:40:38.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.96,0:40:40.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you handle dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.63,0:40:43.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.26,0:40:51.26,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Fukuoka Airport International Flights
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.10,0:40:52.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.43,0:40:55.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey again, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.85,0:40:57.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been a while, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.31,0:41:00.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look well, Suzuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.27,0:41:03.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You really love calling \Nout of the blue, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.69,0:41:07.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you always love doing \Nstuff without letting anyone know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.99,0:41:13.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki didn't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.87,0:41:15.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.58,0:41:17.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki? Study?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.41,0:41:18.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.55,0:41:30.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.53,0:41:57.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,...3 meters back...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.18,0:42:20.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,American schools have such \Nlong summer holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.98,0:42:23.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Three whole months!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.48,0:42:29.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take Rika to see the folks \Nin Saga and then go to Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.03,0:42:31.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.79,0:42:46.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.63,0:42:48.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If I did, it wouldn't rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.92,0:42:52.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was right there. You should \Nhave asked to share mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.72,0:42:54.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you if I asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.59,0:42:55.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.93,0:43:01.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ever hear of "shelter from the storm"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.18,0:43:02.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.52,0:43:06.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.65,0:43:07.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.48,0:43:13.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be late \Nfor our study session.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.78,0:43:16.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll go get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.70,0:43:17.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.66,0:43:19.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't waltz through \Nthe house soaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.37,0:43:25.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Shower first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll study after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.51,0:43:32.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.63,0:43:34.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.84,0:43:41.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So Naoki and this Kotoko are \Ntogether all alone now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.68,0:43:43.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.10,0:43:45.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By this time, I bet they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.48,0:43:50.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My, oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.11,0:43:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.44,0:43:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.49,0:43:59.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.24,0:44:01.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I forgot to bring my underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.27,0:44:25.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A-cup, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.94,0:44:29.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wouldn't make a move on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.49,0:44:38.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wish we were together every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.20,0:44:40.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wanna know how to make that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.91,0:44:42.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.83,0:44:47.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just have to marry Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.46,0:44:48.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You and my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.29,0:44:51.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After I've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.25,0:44:53.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.38,0:44:55.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.76,0:44:58.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It will be our secret until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.10,0:45:07.06,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Stewed Pork
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.98,0:45:11.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A woman's inner beauty is most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.81,0:45:17.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll show off my domestic \Nskills with pork and curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.82,0:45:19.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He'll be speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.29,0:45:35.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Simmer for two hours."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.51,0:45:45.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Physics is too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.68,0:45:50.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The word "pulley" makes me wanna barf.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.73,0:45:56.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.36,0:45:59.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did I forget something...?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.99,0:46:05.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, is dinner ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.95,0:46:09.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.71,0:46:13.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was studying and forgot to check the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.83,0:46:15.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.38,0:46:17.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then there was a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.63,0:46:21.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.23,0:46:34.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow! Is there anything you can't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.98,0:46:38.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Anyone can make curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.44,0:46:42.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's strange. Curry is \Nsupposed to be my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.04,0:46:52.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get the pressure cooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.71,0:46:54.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.09,0:47:05.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It shortens the cooking time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.80,0:47:08.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.06,0:47:13.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Give everyone my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.98,0:47:21.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't forget our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.78,0:47:24.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See ya, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.13,0:47:46.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.80,0:47:51.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even I can make a salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:48:00.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well? Looks good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.94,0:48:01.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The cucumbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:05.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Their shape is a little off, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.36,0:48:06.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.99,0:48:10.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh, so even you have preferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.83,0:48:13.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll eat them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.42,0:48:26.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.44,0:48:37.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.27,0:48:41.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, do you cook often?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.52,0:48:42.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This was the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.49,0:48:47.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.82,0:48:48.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.91,0:48:52.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With just the two of us.... \NIt's like we're newlyweds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.37,0:48:55.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.58,0:49:01.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.63,0:49:05.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like \Nyou to teach me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.92,0:49:07.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.42,0:49:08.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.97,0:49:12.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Physics is just a report, \Nit's not on the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:14.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.85,0:49:18.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You have no idea what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.31,0:49:20.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Quite right!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.40,0:49:21.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.40,0:49:22.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.90,0:49:25.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I only promised to help you on the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.32,0:49:28.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.20,0:49:30.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just review your notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.11,0:49:34.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Actually, I didn't take any notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.54,0:49:37.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.70,0:49:40.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Help! Irie, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.33,0:49:44.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm night blind, and I get \Nreally nervous in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.79,0:49:47.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.42,0:49:49.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Always overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.38,0:49:51.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.43,0:49:58.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We can't study in the dark, \Nso let's start at five a.m., okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.68,0:50:00.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.64,0:50:04.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I haven't slept enough \Nlately, so I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.48,0:50:07.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.24,0:50:09.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.74,0:50:19.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I feel like a burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.79,0:50:23.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.38,0:50:26.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I step...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.05,0:50:29.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Without making a sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.17,0:50:30.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.59,0:50:32.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A burglar?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.48,0:51:34.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Notebook, notebook, physics notebook...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.45,0:51:43.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.47,0:51:59.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.64,0:52:02.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I'm not stealing anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.60,0:52:04.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.73,0:52:06.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.90,0:52:11.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you're here to make out, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.52,0:52:12.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.82,0:52:16.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I said I wouldn't make a move on you, \Nso you decided to take initiative, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.32,0:52:18.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.41,0:52:22.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't embarass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.41,0:52:23.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.95,0:52:27.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's start out as friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.67,0:52:33.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Start out?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.17,0:52:36.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've no interest in going out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.30,0:52:37.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were messing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.55,0:52:39.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.26,0:52:44.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you'd die \Nbefore taking my charity?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.22,0:52:46.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.73,0:52:53.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's not charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.61,0:52:55.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm doing the favor of borrowing it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.86,0:52:57.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll even let you help me copy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.11,0:53:02.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it? We start at five a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.18,0:53:24.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just wanted to copy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.76,0:53:27.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You won't learn anything that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.53,0:55:05.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, I just got back. I brought you...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.20,0:55:08.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.22,0:55:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.51,0:55:31.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.86,0:55:45.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's see. Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.99,0:55:48.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.12,0:55:50.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.04,0:55:52.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.09,0:56:04.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.88,0:56:05.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.59,0:56:08.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ko-to-ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.22,0:56:11.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck with the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.14,0:56:12.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.81,0:56:15.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.52,0:56:19.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now don't open it until \Nafter you've finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.06,0:56:20.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it! See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.98,0:56:21.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.21,0:56:43.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You may now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.98,0:57:03.61,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Midterm Examination Schedule \NDay 1: Math, Modern Japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.28,0:57:15.66,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Day 2: English, Classical Japanese \NDay 3: Japanese History, Chemistry
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.17,0:57:23.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.34,0:57:27.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.30,0:57:29.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, let's blow off some steam!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.03,0:57:49.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.74,0:57:51.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.58,0:57:57.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.62,0:58:00.21,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,No.1: Naoki Irie - Score: 800
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.92,0:58:12.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, congratulations. You were\N on top again. With a perfect score!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.39,0:58:13.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.43,0:58:14.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.72,0:58:15.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Didn't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.31,0:58:19.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.14,0:58:21.81,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,No.100: Kotoko Aihara - Score: 597
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.43,0:58:20.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.100!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.77,0:58:26.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I did it! I did! Irie, I really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.69,0:58:31.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you embarrassed, shouting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.49,0:58:35.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you. I owe it all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.12,0:58:38.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not shaking hands. \NYou promised me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.75,0:58:41.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.79,0:58:45.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not a flag, don't wave it around. Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.09,0:58:48.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.96,0:58:51.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't push.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.63,0:58:54.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Something's up between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.19,0:59:05.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, when did you take this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.94,0:59:09.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What in the name of...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.78,0:59:10.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You and Irie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.99,0:59:12.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So lovey-dovey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.12,0:59:20.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.37,0:59:22.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your dads are childhood friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.66,0:59:24.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.67,0:59:26.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So you're living in his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.42,0:59:28.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's why you're always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.75,0:59:31.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you did better on the test thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.71,0:59:34.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So... do you share a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.43,0:59:35.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.72,0:59:37.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But you sleep in the same room?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.22,0:59:38.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.05,0:59:39.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How often do you have sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.18,0:59:40.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.31,0:59:42.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really? How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.48,0:59:45.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We only talk when studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.85,0:59:47.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, he's ice at home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.98,0:59:51.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.28,0:59:53.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Poor Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.82,0:59:57.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep this secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.78,0:59:59.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.12,1:00:04.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, let's actually go party, and cheer Kotoko up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.21,1:00:05.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.08,1:00:06.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.75,1:00:11.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.67,1:00:14.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you think she's going out with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.59,1:00:18.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.26,1:00:20.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,None of my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:36.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She made the top 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.45,1:00:38.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She made Tonan High School history!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.16,1:00:40.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And she's in class F!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.29,1:00:48.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.96,1:00:50.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.75,1:00:52.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,O...Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.76,1:01:03.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.39,1:01:06.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.35,1:01:07.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You took the words out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.52,1:01:14.57,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,The rumored couple, currently living together: \N3-A Naoki Irie, 3-F Kotoko Aihara
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.61,1:01:20.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's like all you do is trip me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.53,1:01:26.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I told you to stay out of my hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.67,1:01:32.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're an utter annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:56.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I never cried before, \Nno matter how mean he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.99,1:01:59.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.99,1:02:02.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,can't help but like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.99,1:02:05.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I like him so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.09,1:02:27.43,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,25th Tonan High School Sports Meet, in association with \NTonan University
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.55,1:02:25.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a clear day for the Tonan \NHigh School Sports Meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.85,1:02:29.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Presently, class F enjoys a large lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.31,1:02:32.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will they come out on top once again this year?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.13,1:03:03.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next up is the boys 100 meter \Nrace, for the senior class.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.72,1:03:06.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.68,1:03:09.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.68,1:03:13.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I won't lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.40,1:03:16.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On your marks!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.82,1:03:21.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.52,1:03:55.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yo! Yo! How does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.69,1:04:09.70,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,F class's Ace Kinnosuke Ikezawa
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.07,1:04:03.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, great job!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.86,1:04:04.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.90,1:04:05.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.53,1:04:10.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, you're the best!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.87,1:04:11.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.91,1:04:18.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was a bit relieved to see you lose to Kin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.58,1:04:23.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It shows you're human like us after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.76,1:04:25.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.76,1:04:26.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.68,1:04:29.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why would I exert myself for a race like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.60,1:04:32.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Spoken like a sore loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.77,1:04:35.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sore loser?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.52,1:04:42.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you aren't, go on and prove \Nme otherwise in the mixed relay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.32,1:04:45.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll show you what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.78,1:04:54.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll show you class F pride! We won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.46,1:04:59.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Keep at it, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.17,1:05:03.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko, as the front runner, \Ngive it all you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.25,1:05:04.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.51,1:05:07.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Umezaburo, be in first place \Nwhen you pass me the baton.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.30,1:05:10.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I actually tend to cave under pressure...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.22,1:05:11.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.30,1:05:12.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, you're our anchor!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.93,1:05:14.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.01,1:05:15.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.40,1:05:23.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,First runners, on your marks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.82,1:05:28.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now for the last event. \NThe seniors mixed relay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.66,1:05:31.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On your marks!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.99,1:05:34.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get set!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.92,1:05:46.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go go, Jinko! Like that! \NKeep it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.85,1:05:57.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Class F hands the baton off first.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.93,1:05:58.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's up to you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.18,1:05:59.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.40,1:06:06.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,F is in the lead! Behind them are class A and class E!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.98,1:06:09.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.20,1:06:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.12,1:06:22.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,F has an unquestioned lead \Nheading into the anchor hand off!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.25,1:06:24.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Victory is ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.38,1:06:27.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the loser this time, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.88,1:06:31.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Watch me. Watch...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.47,1:06:35.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Irie is staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.72,1:06:38.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.89,1:06:44.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's this?! Aihara has \Npassed the baton to Irie from class A!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.56,1:06:45.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.61,1:06:47.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.44,1:06:49.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is she stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.86,1:06:51.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, what are you doing? Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.70,1:06:58.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, sorry! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.25,1:07:02.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The gap is narrowing!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.42,1:07:14.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie is getting closer! Ikezawa is desperate!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.76,1:07:17.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.68,1:07:27.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A dead heat, each team is at the goal \Nline cheering their teammate on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.91,1:07:45.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't jump onto the track, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.33,1:07:51.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yo, Iridiot. What are \Nyou doing on top of her?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.72,1:07:53.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.63,1:07:55.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.05,1:07:59.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If she'd passed the baton \Ncorrectly we would have won.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.51,1:08:02.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Spoken like a sore loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.23,1:08:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.27,1:08:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bro! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.15,1:08:10.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They are a couple after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.07,1:08:12.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko's lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.61,1:08:17.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone is talking about us again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.28,1:08:19.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.62,1:08:28.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It looks like Irie is carrying \NAihara to the nurse.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.02,1:08:48.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:52.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How many times are you going \Nto watch your little candid video?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.57,1:08:55.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's just so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.15,1:08:57.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Every day for three months\N and you're still not done?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.74,1:08:59.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.49,1:09:03.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Besides, the long-range video  \Ncamera your father bought is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.74,1:09:05.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.37,1:09:09.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gotta say, that was a perfect angle. \NYou could do this professionally.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.96,1:09:13.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, it's the subjects that are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.42,1:09:17.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say, where's Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.01,1:09:20.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's always in her room.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.22,1:09:21.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.18,1:09:21.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.69,1:09:30.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie will take the university \Nentrance exam tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.69,1:09:33.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then the one for Tokyo University.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.65,1:09:37.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He tutored me until I took the \Nexam for Tonan University.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.57,1:09:42.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I might not be of much help,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.16,1:09:45.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but I can hope that everything \Ngoes smoothly for him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.08,1:09:48.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Finished!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.71,1:09:57.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.10,1:10:05.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki! You sleep well last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.26,1:10:06.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.14,1:10:07.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.02,1:10:11.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's so nervous you'd \Nthink he's taking the exam.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.44,1:10:15.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mama, it doesn't matter how good \Nyour grades are, exams are a whole other beast!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.57,1:10:20.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When I took the exam, for Tokyo U my \Nmind went blank and then...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.20,1:10:21.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You alright, Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.91,1:10:24.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh my. He has a slight fever!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.53,1:10:26.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On today of all days!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.49,1:10:29.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! I'll bring something special.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.33,1:10:31.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.04,1:10:35.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here, Irie. These always fix me \Nright up when I get sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.71,1:10:37.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, drink!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.76,1:10:41.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.80,1:10:44.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great, he'll be alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.47,1:10:45.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck, bro!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.01,1:10:47.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,These don't cause drowsiness, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.06,1:10:53.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,An antihistamine...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.40,1:10:55.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:57.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It works well, but with side effects.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.86,1:10:58.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Like?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.82,1:10:59.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Drowsiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.24,1:11:02.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.49,1:11:04.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, vomit! Vomit!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.99,1:11:05.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gag yourself! Jam those fingers in!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.78,1:11:06.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.78,1:11:09.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's my fault for trusting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.00,1:11:12.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, what have you done?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.08,1:11:14.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.21,1:11:17.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't apologize, Kotoko. \NIt's the exam jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.17,1:11:22.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I made a good luck charm. I'll go get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.09,1:11:23.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get it hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.26,1:11:26.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ow, you stepped on my foot, girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.01,1:11:28.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.22,1:11:29.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.89,1:11:31.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That should drive the jinx away!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.89,1:11:33.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll hook it to your bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.27,1:11:37.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It fell...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.65,1:11:40.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko! Don't jinx him even more!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.69,1:11:42.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.57,1:11:44.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I nearly flopped!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.91,1:11:49.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, I know some words are \Nsensitive going into exams.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.99,1:11:50.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.79,1:11:53.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.71,1:11:58.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.09,1:12:01.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.71,1:12:03.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.51,1:12:03.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.55,1:12:04.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.72,1:12:46.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Watanabe!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.14,1:12:48.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.97,1:12:50.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My bag is stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.06,1:12:54.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The charm got caught.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.85,1:12:56.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's her fault...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.69,1:12:59.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's this thing made of? \NIt won't budge a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.35,1:13:01.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, go on ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.44,1:13:02.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.40,1:13:04.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll manage somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.32,1:13:08.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.60,1:13:39.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Watanabe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.02,1:13:43.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie, that's the first bell! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.69,1:13:49.45,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,National Center Test for\N University Admissions
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.49,1:13:51.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.95,1:13:54.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.83,1:13:57.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, you still have the charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.79,1:13:59.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's bad luck. I'll remove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.21,1:14:01.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, now it comes off.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.81,1:14:18.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the one who fell down the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.39,1:14:18.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.93,1:14:19.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.69,1:14:25.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You have 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.78,1:14:35.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.24,1:14:38.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The admission ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.29,1:14:44.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.46,1:14:49.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Son, I'm sure she means well, \Nbut be sure to erase that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.46,1:14:50.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.47,1:14:54.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.18,1:14:59.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That stupid...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.32,1:15:12.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Must have broken the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.66,1:15:22.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Use mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.67,1:15:24.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.09,1:15:35.34,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Name: Yuuko Matsumoto
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.34,1:15:36.80,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Name: Naoki Irie
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.06,1:15:48.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,10 minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.88,1:16:09.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.00,1:16:09.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.80,1:16:10.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.09,1:16:13.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The amulet didn't work?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:15.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, it definitely did something!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.84,1:16:17.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.01,1:16:23.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The answers will be in tomorrow's \Nnewspaper. You check my score.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.54,1:16:49.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.13,1:16:52.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.01,1:16:59.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fantastic! A perfect score!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.09,1:17:02.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You really are a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.68,1:17:05.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll have a celebration tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.43,1:17:07.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.15,1:17:15.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe I really am a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.07,1:17:16.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was all pure skill!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.90,1:17:18.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, luck is a skill too!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.45,1:17:21.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Watanabe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.66,1:17:26.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie's score was really something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.79,1:17:29.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even class F is talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.92,1:17:32.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You took the exam with him, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.71,1:17:37.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet he only needed 20 \Nminutes to solve them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.22,1:17:40.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, and your bad luck charm \Nmade sure he only had twenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.60,1:17:43.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.19,1:17:50.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.73,1:17:58.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Watanabe told me about the trouble \Nyou had on the day of the test.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.49,1:18:03.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm nothing but bad luck for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.87,1:18:05.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.79,1:18:10.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm the worst, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.75,1:18:13.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That is completely correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.55,1:18:16.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.88,1:18:20.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was fun, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.01,1:18:26.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was the first time I can remember feeling nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.35,1:18:32.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In a way, you gave me a valuable experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.61,1:18:41.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, bad spirits are cast out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.57,1:18:43.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here's hoping the Tokyo U \Nexam goes off without a hitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.95,1:18:47.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't wait for you to enter my alma mater.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.25,1:18:49.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.79,1:18:53.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, do you have her good luck charm?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.54,1:18:55.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you want me to fail?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:57.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll see him off to the school.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.59,1:19:00.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good idea. You don't mind, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.80,1:19:03.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whatever. Just follow after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.68,1:19:05.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.30,1:19:05.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.43,1:19:09.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You always bring bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.35,1:19:15.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got the charm, so I'll \Nabsorb all the bad luck. Relax!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.27,1:19:19.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, we're here. That should satisfy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.86,1:19:21.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.11,1:19:24.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck. You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.37,1:19:29.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm relieved. No trouble this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.16,1:19:33.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's the charm?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.42,1:19:36.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did I drop it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.71,1:19:39.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.73,1:19:56.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.90,1:20:01.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She just ran in front of my \Ncar, but I didn't hit her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.36,1:20:03.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She fell and hit her head. \NCall an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.32,1:20:04.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A-ambulance...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.90,1:20:07.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can see the hospital. \NIt'll be faster to carry her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.78,1:20:09.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.58,1:20:10.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.25,1:20:19.25,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tokyo Sugimoto Hospital
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.22,1:20:27.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As I slipped into unconsciousness,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.01,1:20:30.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,all I could hear was his heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.81,1:20:36.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.86,1:20:44.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You had us all freaked out, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.66,1:20:51.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, I'm glad you weren't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.37,1:20:54.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? I...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.83,1:20:57.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just a mild concussion.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.04,1:20:58.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.04,1:21:03.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ah, I almost hit the car and...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.59,1:21:06.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.09,1:21:10.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.85,1:21:14.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.60,1:21:20.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Didn't you go to the exam center?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.81,1:21:23.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I had to talk to the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.57,1:21:28.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean you didn't take \Nthe exam for Tokyo University?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.66,1:21:30.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.08,1:21:33.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It matters of course!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.79,1:21:34.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Iri!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.20,1:21:37.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.79,1:21:42.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.63,1:21:44.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, Ai, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.67,1:21:47.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My silly daughter...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.88,1:21:52.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She put Naoki into this position.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.85,1:21:54.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.93,1:21:56.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.60,1:21:59.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Raise your head, Ai.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.90,1:22:04.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He chose not to go to the center.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.69,1:22:10.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He took Kotoko to the hospital, instead..
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:16.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Saving her life is more important \Nthan Tokyo University.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.29,1:22:20.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.33,1:22:23.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.88,1:22:27.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you'll go to Tonan University too, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.21,1:22:29.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I suppose I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.88,1:22:33.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good for you, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.18,1:22:36.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'll be in the same school again this April!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.56,1:22:42.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great! Great, great, great!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.76,1:23:18.22,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,To the Irie family
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.64,1:23:25.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To everyone in the Irie family. Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.07,1:23:28.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.91,1:23:43.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.33,1:23:44.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Running away?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.58,1:23:45.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:47.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.30,1:23:52.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is this because of Tokyo University?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.38,1:23:56.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I really do just bring you bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.39,1:24:00.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I could have taken the \Nexam after the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.18,1:24:03.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.48,1:24:08.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I never really had a goal \Nin mind for Tokyo U,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.40,1:24:12.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and lately, I've been having\N more fun around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.78,1:24:16.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Taking the escalator to \NTonan U doesn't sound so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.12,1:24:22.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you saying you'll go \Nthere because I'll be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.50,1:24:24.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't read too much into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.83,1:24:27.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I said what I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.42,1:24:30.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You can go now. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.25,1:24:32.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.13,1:24:34.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.88,1:24:40.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I won't trouble you anymore, \Ncan I please stay a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.10,1:24:42.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You will always be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.10,1:24:47.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I can guarantee exciting days.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.90,1:24:49.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Getting cocky already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.36,1:24:52.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess. But...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.44,1:24:56.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whatever. Get inside before my mom notices.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.70,1:24:58.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.87,1:25:00.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.53,1:25:04.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I still like you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.08,1:25:06.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.97,1:25:23.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's finally graduation day.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.89,1:25:26.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko's graduating high school.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.85,1:25:28.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your mom in heaven is happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.85,1:25:30.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.98,1:25:36.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's good that you two will \Nattend the same university.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.44,1:25:37.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.53,1:25:39.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.66,1:25:42.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I should be going.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.99,1:25:45.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.08,1:25:50.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's your final day of high school. \NGo together for once. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.38,1:25:52.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.71,1:25:55.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.05,1:25:59.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait up, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.89,1:26:04.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's our final day, let's walk together.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.81,1:26:12.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time sure flies. We're graduating at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.27,1:26:17.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But y'know, out of all of high school,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.49,1:26:22.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,this year was the best one, \Nsince I could spend it with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.37,1:26:27.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was the hardest year \Nin my 18 years of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.96,1:26:41.43,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tonan University Affiliated High School - 25th Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.52,1:26:51.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That girl kept crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.02,1:26:52.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.69,1:26:56.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was impressed with the principal's speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.77,1:26:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.23,1:26:57.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were asleep, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.78,1:27:01.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We can finally say good-bye to class F.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.53,1:27:04.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So long to the curse of class F.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.20,1:27:06.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Three long years!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.28,1:27:09.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Kotoko's long, one-sided love affair.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.71,1:27:18.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Girls! Congratulations on your graduation!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.42,1:27:20.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.51,1:27:21.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take your picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.47,1:27:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.76,1:27:29.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, look!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.73,1:27:32.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.48,1:27:34.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't you have a gift for Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.77,1:27:35.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.69,1:27:36.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about the two of you in a—
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.65,1:27:37.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.19,1:27:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awww!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.36,1:27:44.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, class F has a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.41,1:27:49.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Drum roll! An Irie doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.24,1:27:51.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.21,1:27:57.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Most of class F was only able to graduate \Nbecause of the notes Kotoko borrowed from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.29,1:27:58.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thus, the gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.88,1:28:00.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.38,1:28:02.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.92,1:28:05.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A Kotoko doll!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.38,1:28:07.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.26,1:28:07.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But when?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.76,1:28:09.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We made them secretly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.85,1:28:11.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think? They're a set!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.47,1:28:13.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't like them at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.48,1:28:18.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you giving him something?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.27,1:28:22.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, um...I will, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.99,1:28:25.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not like you to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.53,1:28:28.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're always giving me stuff anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.45,1:28:30.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's right! Hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.46,1:28:37.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.08,1:28:39.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.38,1:28:41.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.00,1:28:43.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.09,1:28:44.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He actually...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.09,1:28:45.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Accepted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.17,1:28:47.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Goodness, Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.93,1:28:49.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about that picture, now?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.85,1:28:52.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. But just one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.81,1:28:55.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, isn't this wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.81,1:28:57.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.14,1:28:58.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Together! Real close, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.86,1:28:59.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.36,1:29:02.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.48,1:29:05.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, smile!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.90,1:29:09.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you know that in flower symbology, \Na yellow tulip stands for...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.70,1:29:12.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Unrequited love?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.33,1:29:13.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.45,1:29:17.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, you're a sadist!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.29,1:29:21.21,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tonan High School\NSenior F Class
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.48,1:29:44.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think? My own cooking! Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.15,1:29:48.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Enjoy, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.95,1:29:52.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Amazing, Kin! You're a good cook, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.16,1:29:55.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gonna make my way \Nin the world with these skills!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.20,1:30:02.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ikeda. It's a shame about your entrance exam, \Nbut I know you can make it as a chef!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.25,1:30:04.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet you'll be a famous one!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.71,1:30:08.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You bet. It's the first step in \NOperation: "I Love Kotoko".
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.55,1:30:10.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"I love Kotoko?"
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.02,1:30:28.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love you, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.99,1:30:32.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I was in love with that other jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.66,1:30:35.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.20,1:30:37.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.25,1:30:41.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,From now on, you can depend on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.34,1:30:52.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin, everything's set.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.06,1:31:02.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll now express my love \Nfor Kotoko in a dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.94,1:31:06.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please enjoy, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.86,1:31:11.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ugh, class F is here too?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.58,1:31:18.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.16,1:31:20.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, class A, look alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.62,1:31:23.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The same venue?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.50,1:31:25.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey look, it's class A!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.71,1:31:26.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.13,1:31:30.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to congratulate class A on it's graduation.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.51,1:31:35.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your brilliance has made me proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.68,1:31:44.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Many of you  will be entering Tokyo University, \Nand that is another source of pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.10,1:31:46.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Youth is not all about study.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.40,1:31:53.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,These kids have been insulted as failures, \Nbut their ability to withstand that is worth praise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.36,1:31:59.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Intelligence only means so much. \NIt's more important to have a warm heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.62,1:32:05.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want you all to never make excuses, \Nthe way class F does.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.92,1:32:10.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My only regret is Irie's situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.59,1:32:16.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Someone in class F prevented \Nhim from taking the exam.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.64,1:32:18.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He would've been a top ranked \Napplicant to Tokyo U, otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.80,1:32:21.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko didn't do it on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.56,1:32:24.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No one who would say something \Nlike that should be a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.81,1:32:26.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.31,1:32:28.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not her fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.27,1:32:34.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And it's humiliating to think anyone believes \Nthis idiot could knock my life off course.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.61,1:32:38.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Humiliating? Isn't that going too far?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.91,1:32:40.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What part of it didn't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.83,1:32:43.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're so sadistic! And cold blooded!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.04,1:32:45.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And yet you like me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.16,1:32:47.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even gave him a love letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.71,1:32:50.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And got rejected immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.01,1:32:56.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.43,1:33:01.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you're going to take it \Nthis far, you must be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.60,1:33:02.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.39,1:33:05.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.94,1:33:09.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.15,1:33:14.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get a load of Irie's baby picture!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.32,1:33:19.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Turns out he's got a thing for cross-dressing!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.70,1:33:22.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your mom gave me another.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.75,1:33:25.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.63,1:33:33.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll love you forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.89,1:33:41.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.56,1:33:46.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was a hell of a stunt you pulled.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.56,1:33:50.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your threats don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.56,1:33:54.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How dare you make fun of my \Nfeelings in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.57,1:33:57.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.82,1:34:02.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I give up on liking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.62,1:34:06.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're gonna forget all about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.95,1:34:08.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.50,1:34:11.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Forget all about you, find a cool guy at university and...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.79,1:34:13.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.19,1:34:33.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.38,1:34:58.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We kissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.52,1:35:11.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love you, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.69,1:35:15.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really? Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.19,1:35:17.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.82,1:35:21.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.78,1:35:24.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.83,1:35:31.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.00,1:35:32.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.43,1:35:49.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.85,1:35:55.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I brewed it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.23,1:35:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.05,1:36:26.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki, that's too plain! Why are you \Nwearing that dour old thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.72,1:36:32.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I put together something that matches \NKotoko's outfit for the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.60,1:36:34.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am not wearing that.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.60,1:36:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.98,1:36:39.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.49,1:36:44.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.49,1:36:45.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.28,1:36:47.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm off too.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.95,1:36:49.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.71,1:37:01.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Things have been awkward since...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.10,1:37:18.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.81,1:37:24.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,One more step and you'll get a bloody nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.20,1:37:30.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What're you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.96,1:37:41.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, don't call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.88,1:37:43.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You saying you're not?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.34,1:37:46.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should at least ask if I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.22,1:37:49.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, we've kissed...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.68,1:37:55.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why do you keep calling me stupid? \NCan't you be nicer to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.56,1:38:03.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Did he call me Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.73,1:38:07.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He did, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.66,1:38:15.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.36,1:38:58.16,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Itazura na Kiss: High School Chapter
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.16,1:39:00.16,Signs,,0,0,0,,
